---
const rows = [
  {
    title: 'Your customers are already looking',
    body: 'People find a place to eat or a shop to visit on their phone, before they walk in. If your business does not show up with a menu, hours, and a way to order, they pick the place that does.',
  },
  {
    title: 'A website works after hours',
    body: 'Your menu, prices, hours, and order button are open at midnight, on Sundays, on holidays. One customer who orders at 11 at night is an order you got while you slept.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Facebook is not a website',
    body: 'Facebook is where people look at friends. Your website is where they order, book, call, and check your prices. The best businesses have both, and the website does the work.',
  },
  {
    title: 'It fights your competitors for you',
    body: 'A clean site with a menu and an order button wins the tie. That decision is made before anyone picks up the phone, and a good website tips it your way.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section section--paper container" id="why">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <h2>Why a website pays for itself</h2>
    <p>You have run a good business for years. Here is what changed: customers start the search on their phone, and a website is how you get picked.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="why">
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <article class="why__row reveal" style={`transition-delay: ${i * 60}ms`}>
        <span class="why__num" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span>
        <div class="why__copy">
          <h3 class="why__title">{r.title}</h3>
          <p class="why__body">{r.body}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section--paper { background: var(--paper-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .why { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .why__row {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 30px 30px 24px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex; gap: 18px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .why__row:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .why__num {
    flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 11px;
    background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent-deep);
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 650;
  }
  .why__title { font-size: 1.12rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .why__body { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .why { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>